0. Scenario PnL: risk-off = -30000 + 15000 + 800 + 12500 - 301.50 - 25 - 2000 = -4026.50; tech squeeze = 10000 - 5000 - 2000 + 0 - 301.50 - 25 - 2000 = 673.50; index-flat AAPL squeeze = 0 + 0 - 3000 + 0 - 301.50 - 25 - 2000 = -5326.50.","proof_statement":"VERIFIED: the hashed problem+rubric packet is self-contained, the canonical derivation is present in the review record, and the canonical answer passes the local grader through the existing code path.","notes":[]}
